{{Documentation}}
This template is meant to be used on module documentations. This is taken from [[weirdgloop:osw:Template:DependencyList]].

{{t|Dependency list|<Module name>|category=<true/false>}}

All parameters are optional. If <code>Module name</code> is omitted the page name will be used instead; <code>/doc</code> is automatically removed. 

If <code>category</code> is <code>false</code> then no categories will be added to the page, the default value is <code>true</code>.

==Examples==
{{T|Dependency list|Module:Cat Stats 1.2}}
{{Dependency list|Module:Cat Stats 1.2|category=false}}